          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 132305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu parametreleri URL'ye <code>?</code> işaretinden sonra eklenir. Uç noktayı değiştirmezler, ancak sunucuya ek bilgiler sağlarlar.</p><p>Burada <code>name</code> anahtardır ve <code>Maria</code> geçirilen değerdir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/greet?name=Maria\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>?</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu parametreleri URL'ye <code>?</code> işaretinden sonra eklenir. Uç noktayı değiştirmezler, ancak sunucuya ek bilgiler sağlarlar.</p><p><code>name</code> adlı sorgu parametresinin değeri olarak <code>Maria</code> gönder.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/greet?name=Maria\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>?</code>, ardından <code>name</code> ve son olarak <code>Maria</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 132306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>req.query.key</code> kullanarak sorgu parametrelerinin değerine erişebiliriz. Bir sorgu parametresinin değerini döndüren bir uç nokta oluşturalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Maria!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>req</code>, ardından <code>query</code> ve son olarak <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu parametresi değerlerine <code>req.query.key</code> ile erişebilirsin. Sorgu parametresinin değerini döndüren bir uç nokta oluştur.</p><p><code>/greet?name=Maria</code> isteğinde selamlamada kullanılan sorgu değerini oku.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Maria!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>req</code>, ardından <code>query</code> ve son olarak <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu parametreleri doğaları gereği isteğe bağlıdır. Bir sorgu parametresi sağlamazsak değeri undefined olur.</p><p>Yaygın bir kullanım alanı, <code>||</code> ile varsayılan değerler sağlamaktır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>||</code>, ardından <code>\"Guest\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu parametreleri doğaları gereği isteğe bağlıdır. Bir sorgu parametresi sağlamazsan değeri undefined olur.</p><p>Yaygın bir kullanım alanı, <code>||</code> ile varsayılan değerler sağlamaktır.</p><p><code>name</code> eksik olduğunda <code>Guest</code> kullan. <code>Maria</code> gibi sağlanan bir adı koru.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>||</code>, ardından <code>\"Guest\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 132470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>undefined</code>, <code>null</code> veya boş değerler arasında ayrım yapmak isteyebilirsin. <code>??</code> (nullish coalescing operatörü) burada yardımcı olur.</p><p><code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code> ve falsy değerleri (<code>0</code> veya <code>\"\"</code> gibi) aynı şekilde değerlendiren <code>||</code>'den farklı olarak <code>??</code> yalnızca <code>null</code> ve <code>undefined</code>'ı dikkate alır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>??</code>, ardından <code>\"Guest\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>undefined</code>, <code>null</code> veya boş değerler arasında ayrım yapmak isteyebilirsin. <code>??</code> (nullish coalescing operatörü) burada yardımcı olur.</p><p><code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code> ve falsy değerleri (<code>0</code> veya <code>\"\"</code> gibi) aynı şekilde değerlendiren <code>||</code>'den farklı olarak <code>??</code> yalnızca <code>null</code> ve <code>undefined</code>'ı dikkate alır.</p><p><code>name</code> eksik olduğunda <code>Guest</code> kullan, ancak sağlanmışsa boş string’i koru.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>??</code>, ardından <code>\"Guest\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Burada <code>??</code>, <code>\"\"</code> veya <code>0</code> değerlerinin varsayılan değeri tetiklememesini sağlar.</p><p>name sorgu parametresi için boş bir dize aldığında <code>\"Hello, \"</code> demen gerekebilir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>??</code>, ardından <code>\"Guest\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Burada <code>??</code>, <code>\"\"</code> veya <code>0</code> değerlerinin varsayılan değeri tetiklememesini sağlar.</p><p>name sorgu parametresi için boş bir dize aldığında <code>\"Hello, \"</code> demen gerekebilir.</p><p>Boş adı koru, ardından selamlamayı bir yanıt değişkeni üzerinden gönder.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"get\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"query\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"?\" /><text value=\"?\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greeting\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Hello, ${name}`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"greeting\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"129\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>req.query.name</code>, ardından <code>??</code>, <code>\"Guest\"</code>, <code>greeting</code> ve son olarak <code>greeting</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
