            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla sorgu parametremiz olabilir. Bunları URL'de <code>&amp;</code> ile birleştiririz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/info?name=Maria&amp;age=62\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>?</code>, ardından <code>&amp;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla sorgu parametresi kullanabilirsin. Bunları URL’de <code>&amp;</code> ile birleştir.</p><p>Sırasıyla <code>name</code> olarak <code>Maria</code>, <code>age</code> olarak <code>62</code> gönder.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/info?name=Maria&amp;age=62\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>?</code>, ardından <code>name</code>, <code>&amp;</code> ve son olarak <code>age</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
